{"id":8559,"date":"2022-04-05T03:17:35","date_gmt":"2022-04-05T03:17:35","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/?page_id=8559"},"modified":"2025-09-22T18:20:33","modified_gmt":"2025-09-22T22:20:33","slug":"request-a-demo","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/request-a-demo\/","title":{"rendered":"Request A Demo"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"8559\" class=\"elementor elementor-8559\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-140f252a elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"140f252a\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[],&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-9043ce7\" data-id=\"9043ce7\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-569037ff elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"569037ff\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">See What RethinkBH Can Do For Your ABA Practice\n\n<\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f07bdaf elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f07bdaf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Be the person that brings a healthier culture to your workplace, helps keep your team and clients on the same page, and promotes best practices in everything you do.<\/p><p>Partnering with RethinkBH means your staff and clients always have someone in their corner ready to go the extra mile to see them succeed. Schedule a demo today and learn why we\u2019re the best at connecting providers with the most intuitive, advanced clinical tools on the market.<\/p><p>Whether you want to improve outcomes for your clients or run your practice more efficiently, RethinkBH can help.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-2bcb26de\" data-id=\"2bcb26de\" data-element_type=\"column\" id=\"requestADemoPage\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-19c88461 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"19c88461\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Request a Demo<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-47edbb63 e-transform elementor-widget__width-auto elementor-absolute elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"47edbb63\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_transform_flipX_effect&quot;:&quot;transform&quot;,&quot;_position&quot;:&quot;absolute&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"39\" height=\"62\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/icon-arrow-orange.svg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-4204\" alt=\"icon arrow orange\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-842d83d elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"842d83d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" id=\"hubSpotHTML\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- LeanData BookIt code -->\r\n<script>\r\n  function trySettingFormTarget(form) {\r\n    if (window['LDBookItV2'] && window['LDBookItV2'].setFormTarget) {\r\n      LDBookItV2.setFormTarget(form && form.id ? form : (form && form[0] ? form[0] : form));\r\n    } else {\r\n      window.setTimeout(() => trySettingFormTarget(form), 2000);\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  (function loadLeanData() {\r\n    var _ld_scriptEl = document.createElement('script');\r\n    _ld_scriptEl.src = 'https:\/\/cdn.leandata.com\/js-snippet\/ld-book-v2.js';\r\n    _ld_scriptEl.addEventListener('load', function () {\r\n      LDBookItV2.initialize('00Do0000000bYp9EAE', 'bh demo request', 'ld_bookit_log_id', {\r\n        autoSubmit: true,\r\n        popupModalCloseURL: 'https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/request-a-demo\/form-confirmation-demo\/'\r\n      });\r\n      LDBookItV2.setFormProvider('hubspot_embed');\r\n    });\r\n    document.body.appendChild(_ld_scriptEl);\r\n  })();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<!-- HubSpot with ZeroBounce -->\r\n<script charset=\"utf-8\" type=\"text\/javascript\" src=\"https:\/\/js.hsforms.net\/forms\/embed\/v2.js\"><\/script>\r\n<div id=\"hubspot-form-request-demo\"><\/div>\r\n<script>\r\n  (function () {\r\n    \/\/ guard: ensure HubSpot is loaded\r\n    if (!window.hbspt || !hbspt.forms || !hbspt.forms.create) return;\r\n\r\n    hbspt.forms.create({\r\n      portalId: '2900416',\r\n      formId: '5fa08bca-5b6e-4548-aaf3-014844e81928',\r\n      target: '#hubspot-form-request-demo',   \/\/ optional but explicit\r\n      sfdcCampaignId: '7015c000001aFE8AAM',\r\n      css: '',\r\n      cssClass: 'hubSpotForm',\r\n\r\n      \/\/ single onFormReady that does BOTH: ZeroBounce + LeanData\r\n      onFormReady: function ($form) {\r\n        \/\/ --- ZeroBounce ---\r\n        const zbConfig = {\r\n          apiKey: '1b894e1494304a2388b38304a6e91615', \/\/ your public API key\r\n          disableSubmitOnError: true,\r\n          hubspotFormId: '5fa08bca-5b6e-4548-aaf3-014844e81928'\r\n        };\r\n\r\n        function initZeroBounce() {\r\n          if (typeof initializeZeroBounce === 'function') {\r\n            try { initializeZeroBounce(zbConfig); } catch (e) { console.error('ZeroBounce init error:', e); }\r\n          } else {\r\n            console.error('initializeZeroBounce function not found.');\r\n          }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        if (!window.__zbWidgetLoaded) {\r\n          const script = document.createElement('script');\r\n          script.src = 'https:\/\/www.zerobounce.net\/widget\/ZeroBounceHubSpotValidationWidget.js';\r\n          script.async = true;\r\n          script.onload = function () {\r\n            window.__zbWidgetLoaded = true;\r\n            initZeroBounce();\r\n          };\r\n          document.head.appendChild(script);\r\n        } else {\r\n          initZeroBounce();\r\n        }\r\n\r\n  \/\/ --- CUSTOM: ZeroBounce Error Message Handling ---\r\n        const emailFieldWrapper = $form.find('.hs-email');\r\n        const emailInput = emailFieldWrapper.find('input[type=\"email\"]');\r\n        const errorMessageId = 'zb-error-message';\r\n        const errorHtml = `<span id=\"${errorMessageId}\" style=\"color: red; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 5px; display: none;\">Please enter a valid email address.<\/span>`;\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Add the error message element to the DOM if it doesn't already exist\r\n        if (emailFieldWrapper.length && !document.getElementById(errorMessageId)) {\r\n          emailFieldWrapper.append(errorHtml);\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        const errorMessageElement = document.getElementById(errorMessageId);\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Listen for ZeroBounce validation events\r\n        document.addEventListener('ZeroBounceValidation', function (event) {\r\n          const status = event.detail.status;\r\n          if (status !== 'valid' && status !== 'accept_all' && status !== 'unknown') {\r\n            \/\/ Show the error message for invalid emails\r\n            errorMessageElement.style.display = 'block';\r\n          } else {\r\n            \/\/ Hide the error message for valid or acceptable emails\r\n            errorMessageElement.style.display = 'none';\r\n          }\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Hide the error message when the user starts typing again\r\n        emailInput.on('input', function() {\r\n            if (errorMessageElement) {\r\n                errorMessageElement.style.display = 'none';\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ --- LeanData target binding ---\r\n        trySettingFormTarget($form && $form[0] ? $form[0] : $form);\r\n      }\r\n    });\r\n  })();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<!-- Styles -->\r\n<style>\r\n#requestADemoPage .hbspt-form label span,\r\n#requestADemoPage .legal-consent-container div p {\r\n\tcolor: var(--e-global-color-46b08c7 )\r\n}\r\n\r\n#requestADemoPage .hubSpotForm {\r\n    padding: 3% 6% 10% 6%;\r\n}\r\n\r\n#requestADemoPage div.hs_error_rollup,\r\n#requestADemoPage .hs_submit.hs-submit {\r\n\ttext-align: center\t\r\n}\r\n\r\n#requestADemoPage .hs_submit.hs-submit {\r\n\tmargin-top: 30px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n#requestADemoPage .hubSpotForm.hs-custom-style .field.hs-form-field {\r\n    margin-bottom: 25px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n#requestADemoPage .hubSpotForm .legal-consent-container ul.inputs-list {\r\n\tlist-style: none;\r\n\tpadding-left: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n#requestADemoPage .hubSpotForm .legal-consent-container label.hs-form-booleancheckbox-display {\r\n\ttext-align:left;\r\n}\r\n\r\n#requestADemoPage .hubSpotForm .legal-consent-container label.hs-form-booleancheckbox-display span {\r\n\tpadding-left: 10px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n#requestADemoPage .hubSpotForm input[type=submit] {\r\n\tcolor: \t\t\t\t#ffffff;\r\n\tbackground-color: \tvar( --e-global-color-d7be9cd );\r\n\tborder-color: \t\tvar( --e-global-color-d7be9cd );\r\n}\r\n\r\n#requestADemoPage .hubSpotForm input[type=submit]:hover {\r\n\tcolor: \t\t\t\tvar( --e-global-color-d7be9cd );\r\n\tbackground-color: \tvar( --e-global-color-d3652da );\r\n\tborder-color: \t\tvar( --e-global-color-d7be9cd );\r\n}\r\n\r\n#requestADemoPage .hubSpotForm .legal-consent-container li.hs-form-booleancheckbox {\r\n\tlist-style: none\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n#requestADemoPage .hubSpotForm label:not(.hs-error-msg):not(.hs-main-font-element), \r\n#requestADemoPage .hubSpotForm .legal-consent-container {\r\n\tcolor: var( --e-global-color-46b08c7 );\r\n\tfont-family: var( --e-global-typography-29c855d-font-family ), Sans-serif;\r\n    font-size: var( --e-global-typography-29c855d-font-size );\r\n    font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-29c855d-font-weight );\r\n    text-transform: var( --e-global-typography-29c855d-text-transform );\r\n    font-style: var( --e-global-typography-29c855d-font-style );\r\n    text-decoration: var( --e-global-typography-29c855d-text-decoration );\r\n    line-height: var( --e-global-typography-29c855d-line-height );\r\n    letter-spacing: var( --e-global-typography-29c855d-letter-spacing );\r\n    word-spacing: var( --e-global-typography-29c855d-word-spacing );\r\n }\r\n\r\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\r\n\t #requestADemoPage .hs_submit.hs-submit {\r\n\t\tmargin-top: 25px;\r\n\t}\r\n}\r\n<\/style>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-49f4d095 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-absolute elementor-view-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon\" data-id=\"49f4d095\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_position&quot;:&quot;absolute&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"icon.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div